<title>UK: Reckett &amp; Colman up on lingering bid talk.</title>
<headline>Reckett &amp; Colman up on lingering bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British household products group Reckitt and Colman Plc bucked the market's weaker trend on Wednesday, jumping to a fresh record peak, amid lingering bid speculation, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1611 GMT, the shares were up 11p to 841-1/2, having climbed as high as 844 earlier.</p>
